  - Color 3: (15,16),(16,15) → 2
  - Color 4: (16,16) → 1
  - Color 5: 0, Color 6: 0

  Removed distribution = [1,2,3,2,1,0,0], so remaining = [40,40,40,40,40,40,40] — **equal**. ✓

## Lifting to 3D

Place the 9 Vertical cells at the 3×3 corner footprint (rows 14–16, columns 14–16), each spanning the full 7m height. In each of the 7 layers, tile the remaining 280 cells with 40 Horizontal cells using the construction above. Total: 9 + 7×40 = 289 cells, volume 2023 m³, no gaps. ✓

